  <jpcrp030000-asr_E02386-000:NotesRegardingInsuranceIncomeTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt;※３　受取保険金&lt;/p&gt;
